    title: 'Project: SMK MQ Landing Page',
    subtitle: 'UI/UX Design',
    description: 'Merancang desain landing page untuk SMK Madinatul Quran.',
    icon: `<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#a3a3a3]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z" /></svg>`,
