  {
    year: '2025',
    title: 'Nonstalgic Game Retro',
    subtitle: 'E-commerce Design',
    description: 'Mendesain platform e-commerce untuk game retro dan nostalgia.',
    icon: `<svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#a3a3a3]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.25 8h-10.5a5.75 5.75 0 00-5.682 6.822 1.5 1.5 0 002.936.43.75.75 0 011.157-.307h13.678a.75.75 0 011.157.307 1.5 1.5 0 002.936-.43A5.75 5.75 0 0017.25 8zM5.625 10.5h.01M6.75 10.5v1.125M7.875 11.25h-1.125M18.75 11.25h.01M17.625 12.375h.01" /></svg>`,
